  "description": "The proposal seeks householder planning permission for the erection of a hip-to-gable roof extension, a double-storey side extension, and a single-storey rear wrap-around extension to the existing dwellinghouse.\n\nThe double-storey side extension will extend along the existing side elevation, providing additional accommodation at both ground and first-floor levels. The design has been carefully developed to comply with the 45-degree rule, ensuring no unacceptable impact on neighbouring properties in terms of daylight, sunlight, outlook, and overall amenity.\n\nThe single-storey rear wrap-around extension will enhance the ground floor living space, improving functionality and internal layout while remaining proportionate to the host dwelling.\n\nOverall, the proposal is considered to be in keeping with the character and appearance of the existing property and surrounding area.",
